        "original_id": "4e8f2530-c5e7-5a6c-9717-c172385149a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimi Mistry, Guy Ritchie, Om Puri, Linda Bassett, Gerard Butler, Tom Wilkinson, Thandie Newton, Mark Strong, Idris Elba, Tom Hardy, Toby Kebbell\n- Films: EastEnders, Coronation Street, East Is East, Blood Diamond, The Guru, Exam, West is West, Ella Enchanted, The Truth About Love, RocknRolla\n- Places: Salford, Lancashire\n- Topics: British film and television, mixed-ethnicity household\n\nFacts:\n- Jimi Mistry was born on 1 January 1973 and is an English actor.\n- Jimi Mistry is best known for roles in EastEnders and Coronation Street.\n- Jimi Mistry appeared in films including East Is East, Blood Diamond, The Guru, Exam, West is West, Ella Enchanted, and The Truth About Love.\n- East Is East is set in Salford, Lancashire, in 1971.\n- East Is East depicts a mixed-ethnicity British household led by Pakistani father George, played by Om Puri, and English mother Ella, played by Linda Bassett.\n- RocknRolla is a 2008 British-American crime comedy film written and directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- RocknRolla stars Gerard Butler, Tom Wilkinson, Thandie Newton, Mark Strong, Idris Elba, Tom Hardy, Jimi Mistry, and Toby Kebbell.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
